  "notes": "Implies a more analytical or data-based approach to predicting than {予想|よそう}. Commonly used in scientific, technical, and business contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {予測|よそく}{不能|ふのう}: unpredictable\n- {予測|よそく}{変換|へんかん}: predictive text (input)\n- {予測|よそく}{精度|せいど}: prediction accuracy\n- {予測|よそく}モデル: prediction model\n- {予測|よそく}{値|ち}: predicted value\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {予想|よそう}する: to expect, to anticipate — more subjective, based on intuition or general judgment\n- {予測|よそく}する: to predict, to forecast — more objective, based on data or scientific analysis\n- {予報|よほう}する: to forecast — specifically for weather and other official forecasts",
